+/* The console language the title is told (dub, subtitles, menus), in order:
+ * PS3_LANG if set -- a CELL_SYSUTIL_LANG_* number or a code: en, en-gb, ja,
+ * fr, es, de, it, nl, pt (Portugal), pt-br, ru, ko, zh-t, zh-s, fi, sv, da,
