+    /* ---- framebuffer fetch (rsx_fp_apply_fbfetch): a decal in inFAMOUS 2's
+     * shape reads two of its own targets at the projected screen texcoord
+     * (units 2 and 3 -> attachments 0 and 1, unit 3 through a crossbar) and
