+ * Level 1 (SPU_FLOAT_APPROX / =1) = RPCS3 "approximate" xfloat for these six ops:
+ *   fa/fs        the native op, nothing else (RPCS3: plain fadd/fsub).
+ *   fm           native multiply, result lanes where either operand is zero (DAZ: denormals
