+ *   rsqrt(0) come out as ~+-FLT_MAX (sign kept) instead of an x86 NaN pattern. Same cost as 1.
+ * Level 3 (SPU_FLOAT_APPROX=3): the frest/frsqest change, all six ops native (no masks): no cost
